#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Living map of the monorepo layout after single-package migration (Phase 0).\n"
"> **Code is SSOT** — when this doc drifts, fix it in the same PR as structural changes.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Packages"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Package           | Path            | Role                                                                         |\n"
"| ----------------- | --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `freeanima`       | repository root | Hub runtime, CLI, capabilities, features, shells — **one `package.json`**    |\n"
"| `@freeanima/site` | `site/`         | Astro/Starlight 文档站（**独立** `package.json` + `bun.lock`，非 workspace） |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:18
msgid ""
"根目录 **无** `workspaces`；`site/` 与产品依赖图分离，内容（`docs/`、`po/`、"
"`messages/`）仍与产品同仓。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Product source (`src/`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"src/\n"
"├── kernel/          # 日志、事件总线、无业务依赖\n"
"├── core/            # 配置、PG schema、repos、LLM 工具\n"
"├── runtime/         # 对话轮次、目标、流水线\n"
"├── platform/        # 组合根：Hub、连接器、SAP、slash commands\n"
"├── capabilities/    # acp, memory, tools, mcp-*, llm-openai, …\n"
"├── features/        # chat, console, task, vault, diary, …\n"
"├── shared/          # hub-rpc, hub-contract, sap-contract, vault-crypto\n"
"├── frontend/        # ui-kit, shell-sdk, shell-ui\n"
"├── app/\n"
"│   ├── cli/         # `anima` CLI（无内层 src/）\n"
"│   └── shell/\n"
"│       ├── desktop/ # Electron：spa/（Vite 根）+ lib/（设置/桥接）\n"
"│       ├── mobile/  # Capacitor\n"
"│       └── web/     # 浏览器全壳层\n"
"└── satellites/      # companion（spa/ + lib/ + server/ sidecar）\n"
"\n"
"内层 Vite SPA 根目录统一称 **`spa/`**（原 `app/`），与交付层 `src/app/` 区分。壳层/卫星的非 SPA 模块用 **`lib/`**（原内层 `src/`）。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Root-level (non-`src/`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:53
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Path                     | Role                                                       |\n"
"| ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `tests/`                 | 集成测试与 helpers（非产品模块）                           |\n"
"| `scripts/`               | 构建、检查、迁移脚本                                       |\n"
"| `docs/`                  | 英文概念/指南文档（源）                                    |\n"
"| `docs/.generated/zh_CN/` | po4a 构建产物（gitignore；site 构建时从 `po/zh_CN/` 生成） |\n"
"| `messages/`              | Paraglide `en.json` / `zh-cn.json`                         |\n"
"| `po/`                    | gettext PO（恢复文档 i18n 时用）                           |\n"
"| `site/`                  | 文档站（独立 install / build）                             |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Module resolution"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:59
msgid ""
"TypeScript：`tsconfig.json` 单一配置；`@freeanima/*` 通过 "
"`compilerOptions.paths` 映射到 `src/**`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:59
msgid ""
"Vite 壳层：`src/frontend/shell-ui/vite/paths.ts` 与别名（`@chat/*`、"
"`@console/*` 等）；feature UI 在 `ui/spa/`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:59
msgid "产品无 workspace 子 `package.json`；`site/` 为兄弟目录独立包。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "护栏"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:66
msgid ""
"`tsconfig.base.json` paths：`@freeanima/*`、`@paraglide/*`（与 Vite `module-"
"aliases.ts` 手动对齐）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:66
msgid ""
"[`.agent/rules/code-layers.md`](../../.agent/rules/code-layers.md)：目录层依"
"赖约定（`src/<layer>/` 前缀）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:66
msgid "已移除 `check-package-cycles.ts`（单包无 workspace 图）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:66
msgid ""
"分发形态仅 **source** 与 **Linux standalone**（`build:cli:executable`）；无 "
"npm/`@freeanima/cli` 发布，无产品 Docker 镜像。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "文档站 i18n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:70
msgid ""
"中文 **PO 译文冻结**（`po/zh_CN/` 保留、不再要求 agent 同步）；"
"`docs/.generated/zh_CN/` **不入库**，site 构建时 `i18n:po4a` 从 PO 生成。PR/"
"`bun run check` **不跑**翻译校验。详见 [`.agent/rules/i18n.md`](../.agent/"
"rules/i18n.md)。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "文档站构建"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:73
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# 产品\n"
"bun install && bun run check\n"
"\n"
"# 文档站（独立 lock）\n"
"cd site && bun install && bun run build\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/repository-topology.md:81
msgid ""
"site `prebuild` 会调用根目录 `i18n:po4a` 与 `paraglide:compile`（共享 `docs/"
"` / `messages/` SSOT）。"
msgstr ""
